  "description": "Da-Eun has been living as a workaholic since her parents' sudden accident. The near-death accident became a new turning point that changed her values ​​in life. She confides her determination and secret to only one person.\n\n *\"I want to have a child.\"*\n\nJae-Han has been by Da-Eun's side for a long time while hiding his feelings. One day, Da-Eun confesses her shocking plan to undergo artificial insemination. She wants to have a child with a sperm of an unknown man? Rather... \n\n *\"I'll give it to you.\"*\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
